From: osm1019 <osm1019@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 16:04:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/22] oplus-fwk: add gallery-share icon helpers + ViewWrapper
 (fix blank share items)

The OPlus gallery's own share sheet (com.oplus.gallery.sharepage.*) showed target
labels with no icons / blank items and dead taps, because OplusGalleryLoadIconHelper
belongs in the oplus-fwk boot jar but was missing, so the gallery fell back to its
bundled null-stub (getInstance/getOplusItem -> null). Add the com.oplus.resolver.*
helpers + com.oplus.widget.OplusItem (from AlphaDroid alpha-16.2 ae13ee26) and the two
inner/view ViewWrapper stubs with the setScroll{X,Y}ForColor fix (0f21520, writes
mScrollX/mScrollY directly instead of recursing) for the share/'More' list scroll.

Additive, self-contained (only cross-ref is OplusItem), and NONE reference camera2/
metadata -- so this is safe and does NOT reintroduce the green-capture regression from
the full 33-stub import (that was the CameraMetadataNative/CaptureResult wrappers, kept
out here). Fixes gallery share on both dodge and salami (shared oplus-fwk). Ref kiro-143/149.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
